Os JSONs de preparação registrarão URLs efetivamente baixadas, hashes oficiais, tamanhos, pacote Debian e versões observadas. Ainda não existem esses registros de imagens: Docker inacessível e DNS indisponível no shell. Não foram inventados digests, checksums ou tamanhos.

## SELinux — 2026-11-06

`TOOLBOX_SELINUX_LABEL=private` habilita volumes `ro,Z` para fonte/base e `rw,Z`
para saída. O padrão permanece sem relabel. Usar somente diretórios dedicados:
`Z` altera o rótulo no host; o consumidor Ec fornece snapshot descartável.
[Docker: Configure the SELinux label](https://docs.docker.com/engine/storage/bind-mounts/),
consultado em 2026-11-06. Não usa privileged nem desabilita SELinux.

- ShellCheck 0.11.0: [release assets](https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/releases/tag/v0.11.0). Release API supplies SHA256; old 0.10.0 preserved; substitution test rejects mismatched download.

- Opengrep 1.33.1: [release and bundled CLI help](https://github.com/opengrep/opengrep/releases/tag/v1.33.1). Local rules, test/scan modes, metrics off, strict errors, disabled suppressions; real execution required.

- OSV-Scanner 2.7.0: [Offline mode and manual database download](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/osv-scanner/v2.7.0/docs/offline-mode.md). Explicit HTTPS database update; immutable local snapshot, age, exact lockfile inventory; scan offline.

- OSV 2.7.0 / SCALIBR 0.5.3: [matcher fixado](https://github.com/google/osv-scalibr/blob/5be78a00e3c2/enricher/vulnmatch/osvlocal/matcher.go). Execução observada exige os dois namespaces de cache; mesma base oficial copiada, hash vinculado ao snapshot. Opengrep 1.33.1: CLI nativa não aceita --metrics; rede none e flags de version-check desativadas.

## Preparação offline — 2026-11-07

| Ferramenta / versão | Fonte oficial consultada | Decisão |
|---|---|---|
| Trivy 0.76.2 | [OCI databases; embedded checks; Maven; update checks and telemetry](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aquasecurity/trivy/v0.76.2/docs/guide/advanced/air-gap.md) | Native DB and Java DB preparation; filesystem vulnerability-only execution with explicit offline flags. Other modes excluded. |
| Trivy 0.76.2 | [DownloadDBOnlyFlag; DownloadJavaDBOnlyFlag; SkipDBUpdateFlag; SkipJavaDBUpdateFlag](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aquasecurity/trivy/v0.76.2/pkg/flag/db_flags.go) | Prepare both DBs separately; skip both updates during scans. |
| Trivy 0.76.2 | [Release assets and digest](https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy/releases/tags/v0.76.2) | Use separate version module; old v0.61.1 release endpoint returned HTTP 404, not silently replaced. |
| OSV-Scanner 2.7.0 | [Specify database location; offline option; manual database download](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/osv-scanner/v2.7.0/docs/offline-mode.md) | Native archive layout, explicit offline mode, preparation from official ecosystem storage. |
| Grype 0.119.0 | [Installation; vulnerability database](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/grype/v0.119.0/README.md) | Official release artifacts and explicit native database preparation; preserve native age validation. |
| Syft 1.23.1 | [CheckForAppUpdate](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/syft/v1.23.1/cmd/syft/internal/options/update_check.go) | Disable app update checks. |
| Syft 1.23.1 | [UseNetwork; ResolveTransitiveDependencies](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/syft/v1.23.1/cmd/syft/internal/options/java.go) | Disable Java network access; filesystem inventory only. |
| Syft 1.23.1 | [SearchRemoteLicenses](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/syft/v1.23.1/cmd/syft/internal/options/golang.go) | Disable remote Go license searches. |
| Syft 1.23.1 | [SearchRemoteLicenses](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/syft/v1.23.1/cmd/syft/internal/options/javascript.go) | Disable remote JavaScript license searches. |
| Syft 1.23.1 | [Release assets and checksums](https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/syft/releases/tags/v1.23.1) | Prepare official Linux AMD64 tarball, require upstream SHA256 checksum file. |

Pendências: Trivy histórico 0.61.1 indisponível na API de releases; OSV histórico 2.0.2 permanece bloqueado; outros modos, arquiteturas e ecossistemas não foram adicionados. Checksums não equivalem a assinatura. Consulte evidências para o que foi realmente executado.

